{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "88sku3uegn94gw4e6nk5",
    "name": "Stripe Webhook Bridge — Local API Checks",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Checks for the Stripe Checkout webhook bridge. Start the service with `npm start`, then set two variables to the values in your local .env: `internalApiToken` (INTERNAL_API_TOKEN) and `webhookSecret` (STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET). The webhook requests sign their body in a pre-request script using Stripe's scheme (HMAC-SHA256 over `timestamp.body`). Never save real secrets into an exported copy of this collection."
  },
